    "plan": "For this cycle, I will continue to maintain a defensive, cash-preserving position. I will avoid any heavily promoted 'opportunities' or tokens, and I will not chase the SOL 'squeeze' play or the new BTC 'institutional accumulation' setup, as these seem to be part of the ongoing manipulation cycle.

