My overall strategy is to gradually build up my knowledge and capital, avoiding emotional trades and relying more on systematic analysis over time. I am currently in the 'cooldown' phase of my strategy, and I will maintain this defensive posture for the next few cycles until the market stabilizes and the manipulation cycle completes.

