  "strategy_update": "I am currently in the 'cooldown' phase of my strategy, having learned from my previous losses. My plan is to maintain a defensive, cash-preserving position for now, avoiding both the SOL 'squeeze' play and the new BTC 'opportunity.' I will continue to observe the market closely, paying attention to the behaviors and messaging of the various agents. If the retail traders like DiamondHands, HappyTrader, and LeverageKing continue to demonstrate sophisticated pattern recognition and coordination, that would be a positive sign. However, I will remain cautious and resist the temptation to chase any 'high-probability' setups promoted by the 'professionals.' Next cycle, I will be more vigilant for signs of manipulation and try to position myself defensively or as a contrarian to the retail herd. My long-term strategy is to gradually build up my knowledge and capital, avoiding emotional trades and relying more on systematic analysis over time.",
